     <P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21.75pt"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>普通高校招生体检工作是高校招生工作的一个重要环节，是维护广大考生合法权益和向高校输送合格人才的一项重要工作。我校的高校招生体检工作将于</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">5</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>月</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">18</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>日</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">-19</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>日进行，根据市考试院高三体检工作会议精神，结合我校实际，特制定以下高三全面体检工作方案。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"><?xml:namespace prefix = "o" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
