<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体"><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold">要求：所有本校在读学生必须从学校出发。学生到校后完成当天的健康码检查和体温检测，发车前<SPAN lang=EN-US>10</SPAN>分钟准时到达东门上车地点，由班主任点名后依次上车。上车后在固定位置就座，不在车内随意走动。到达体检站后依次下车，经由固定通道进入体检站参加体检，期间服从工作人员指挥。体检结束后乘之前的车辆返回，在</SPAN><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">北门下车</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold">后再次测量体温进校 。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">六、校门口上车引导<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">校门口</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>引导上车：</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">汪陈帅 <SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">  </SPAN></SPAN>张帆<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>学生点名：各班主任</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>高二学生点名：</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">汪陈帅<B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>七、安全纪律教育</SPAN></B><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>负责人：各班主任</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>要求：各班必须进行一次体检安全纪律教育，主要内容如下</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21.2pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.76"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">1</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>．交通安全</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21.25pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.77"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>（</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">1</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>）各班学生必须随车跟带队班主任统一行动，去回均应乘学校安排的大客车，去回</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">上</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>车前班主任要负责清点本班学生数。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21.25pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.77"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>（</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>）有序上车，一人一座，不要争抢座位，来回座位固定，车内保持安静，以免影响体检数据。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21.2pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.76"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>．体检纪律</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21.25pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.77"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>在体检场内保持安静，不得大声喧哗，听从引导人员指挥，不要跑动，以免血压、心率异常（血压以当天检查为准，不得复检）。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 26.95pt; TEXT-INDENT: -5.65pt; mso-char-indent-count: -.47; mso-para-margin-left: 2.03gd"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">3</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>．其他事项</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21.25pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.77"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>（</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">1</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>）有关体检情况由考试院转交学校统一发放。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21.25pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.77"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>（</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>）实事求是，不得冒名顶替，一经发现严肃处理。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21.25pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.77"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>（</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">3</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>）搞好个人卫生（洗脚、洗澡、内衣裤整洁）。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21.3pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.77"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>（</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">4</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>）禁止带手机、零食。</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21.25pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.77"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>（</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">5</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>）住院做过手术留有明显疤痕的要带上医院的手术证明（阑尾炎手术除外），体检时医生如果需要查验，请出示。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21.25pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.77"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>（</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">6</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>）<B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal">体检时如果对检查结果有异议，应该及时提出申请或叫带队领导和校医转达申请。</B></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"> <SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21.25pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.77"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>（</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">7</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>）放弃体检的考生向学校提出，由学校汇总，报体检站；如遇特殊情况不能按时体检的学生，须提前</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">1</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>天提出书面申请，经学校批准后方可延期体检，但不能晚于</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">5</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>月</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">21</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>日；对外科体检有特殊要求的学生，可在体检前提出申请，并家长签名，经学校审核，报体检站安排单独体检，无正当理由不得单独体检。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21.25pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.77"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>（</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">8</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>）不能戴隐形眼镜。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21.2pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.02"><?xml:namespace prefix = "v" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml" /><v:rect id=墨迹_x0020_1 style="HEIGHT: 2.95pt; WIDTH: 2.4pt; MARGIN-TOP: 144.2pt; POSITION: absolute; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN-LEFT: 352.55pt; LEFT: 0px; Z-INDEX: 251657216; VISIBILITY: visible" strokeweight=".5mm" filled="f" coordsize="36,55" coordorigin=",1" o:spid="_x0000_s1026"><v:stroke endcap="round"></v:stroke><v:path insetpenok="f" fillok="f" o:extrusionok="f" shadowok="f"></v:path><o:lock text="t" rotation="t" v:ext="edit"></o:lock><o:ink annotation="t" i="AIMBHQIGCAEQWM9UiuaXxU+PBvi60uGbIgMGSBBFMkYyBQU4PT4LZBkfOAkA/v8DAAAAAAA9CADQ&#10;BQMAAHpEPggAtAEDAAB6RAo7DYUGOx80EcdFYIbFmLRZ0ERBwENBwgCH8kX3ki/OHuh0Ph23yHeR&#10;U8CCAACCAAAKABEgoCZ2qD8h1gE=&#10;"></o:ink></v:rect><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>（</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">9</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>）体检期间人员不得聚集，服从体检站工作人员引导安排。体检全程须带好口罩并注意做好个人防护，与他人保持</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">1</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>米间隔，做到安全体检、文明体检、有序体检。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">体检过程中途不得离开，如有急事需要离开，须报告班主任和带队校医。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 29.5pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.45"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>八、班主任注意：<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 10.5pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.0"><v:rect id=墨迹_x0020_2 style="HEIGHT: 56.05pt; WIDTH: 34.45pt; MARGIN-TOP: -15pt; POSITION: absolute; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN-LEFT: 566.75pt; LEFT: 0px; Z-INDEX: 251658240; VISIBILITY: visible" strokeweight="1mm" filled="f" coordsize="1114,1879" o:spid="_x0000_s1027"><v:stroke endcap="round"></v:stroke><v:path insetpenok="f" fillok="f" o:extrusionok="f" shadowok="f"></v:path><o:lock text="t" rotation="t" v:ext="edit"></o:lock><o:ink annotation="t" i="AKYDHQNemAEBEFjPVIrml8VPjwb4utLhmyIDBkgQRWRGZAUFOD0+C2QZHzgJAP7/AwAAAAAAPQgA&#10;0AUDAAB6RD4IALQBAwAAekQK3AJ3hsaZRkBAwEPHICBgIGAQMAQECgIGAmpFAwE1FwGLMSwkJETs&#10;FASFHBICASE+gBAQMACAgYCBgISFgYCBgIEQMBAoGAgUDCSUHAwMHAwMGkE7PRcrAoKAgoGBloyE&#10;hLyru4dDoSICgEBQGAEBgAQGAEBgVMmMBgESzVGoNwr3D+wGAwOkwSAxKjwFAYChkhQEgJASAkBQ&#10;EgKAoCQEgJASAwCAwmQoHAIGQGM4DxztThc8tcDpOoDAIDAI9ErpCIHAbNWbqIfz1+edrHg/kBgC&#10;A8qTwAQIDAAIDAHAB8Gpw4KAZo0DoCQ5XxJAYBUpnKVclMAQGAJNGyAQFAICgEBIBAUAgKNSWAwB&#10;AYAgMAgMAQGAQGAIDJpqBAZtN5tAa+sEDIFH4ylEKgKCeBzfyiugggAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIIA&#10;AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKABEgUOzqqT8h1gE=&#10;"></o:ink></v:rect><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">1.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">班主任随班行动，一个班级去回乘同一辆车，按规定车号上车，各班提前<SPAN lang=EN-US>10</SPAN>分钟到校门口集中。班主任清点本班学生数，如有请假学生及时与周文龙和校医联系。<SPAN lang=EN-US> <o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 11.75pt; mso-char-indent-count: .98"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">2. </SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">班主任统一带好本班学生的体检引导单和血检条形码，</SPAN><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">上车后发给学生，体检引导单体检过程中使用，体检后由学生自行保管；条形码抽血时贴在试管上。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 11.75pt; mso-char-indent-count: .98"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">3</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">．有关上课安排：轮到体检的班级，体检这半天的课改自修。不参加体检的班级按课表上课，带队班主任的课改自修，冲掉的课任课老师可视情况自行调到空缺的地方补上。 <SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 11.9pt; mso-char-indent-count: .99"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">4</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">．体检主检单位地址：绍兴文理学院附属医院（中兴南路<SPAN lang=EN-US>999</SPAN>号）。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">  </SPAN>5</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">．</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>汽车租赁单位：市汽运集团</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">  </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>联系人</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"> </SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>封国琴（</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">15336768326</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>）</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 5.9pt; mso-char-indent-count: .49"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312"><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 270pt; mso-char-indent-count: 22.5"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 270pt; mso-char-indent-count: 22.5"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>绍兴一中教学处</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">                                         </SPAN><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">    </SPAN><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">                                             </SPAN>2020</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>年</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">5</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>月</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">6</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>日</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
    
